What does "vmstat 2" show??  How many page faults per sec?  Do a "man
vmstat" to see what it all means.   ps aux | head -10 show top 10 CPU
users.  netstat shows network stats "netstat 2".  iostat shows I/O disk
stats.  For us "iostat rz16 2" shows our RAID array I/O activity.  Yours
won't be rz16.  How much disk space is left - "df" command.  Check your: 
/usr/var/adm/messages  file to look for any weird errors or warnings.

 

