> stage 2 compiler
[snip]

I think that fix for this was posted here (or was it gnu.gcc.bug?)
some time ago.  Anyway, you need to edit file cp/errfn.c and replace
line 198:

extern errorfn sprintf;

with:

extern int sprintf __((char *, const char *, ...));

I have no idea why gnu people redeclared sprintf in cp/errfn.c, but it
seems that everything works ok if their declaration is replaced with
declaration of sprintf from /usr/include/stdio.h.

