Hi

Try to add the 8-bit option in sendmail.cf:

   ##################
   ###   Options   ###
   ###################

   # 8 bit mail
   O8

Or You can try to add '8' to the flag field in sendmail.cf:

  Before:

   Mlocal, P=3D/bin/mail, F=3DrlsDFMmn, S=3D10, R=3D20, A=3Dmail -r $f -d=
 $u
   Mprog,  P=3D/bin/sh,   F=3DlsDFM,   S=3D10, R=3D20, A=3Dsh -c $u

  After:

   Mlocal, P=3D/bin/mail, F=3DrlsDFMmn8, S=3D10, R=3D20, A=3Dmail -r $f -=
d $u
   Mprog,  P=3D/bin/sh,   F=3DlsDFM8,   S=3D10, R=3D20, A=3Dsh -c $u


