Note that 8-bit mails are forbidden by the RFCs! Except for the latest version
of the SMTP protocol, (starting with EHLO messages), where 8-bit mails may be
used, but only after negotiating it. Be careful! Unnegotiated 8-bit mails are
dangerous and may crash mailer systems. Another approach would be MIME encoding.

