This is my printcap entry:
I set it up using the GUI Printer Setup in DU4.0

# HP1600CM Color Postscript DeskJet printer
lp1|1|color:\
        :lf=/usr/adm/lp1err:\
        :lp=:\
        :mx#0:\
        :rm=qmpcolor:\
        :rp=RAW:\
        :sd=/usr/spool/lpd1:\
        :sh:

You may want to try 'rp=RAW' - the printer should be able to distinguish
whether it is plain text or postscript.

rm: is the name of the printer in Host file, try putting this instead
of the IP address.

Also go into 'lpc' and do a 'restart all'. See if this brings the
printer spool to life.

Joe



