The 'erase' character is set by the stty command, usually in 
your .login file.  
    stty erase ^H
sets it to the CONTROL-H, which is the "normal" backspace key.
    stty erase ^?
sets it to the DELETE key.

You should be able to test where the user is logged in from 
in the .login file and issue the appropriate stty command.

